OL,3,GNEWSA'Unwavering love' of man killed in
OL,4,Acrash remembered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 21-year-old man killed
OL,7,Fin a crash in Oxfordshire have paid
OL,8,Ftribute to his "independent spirit" and
OL,9,F"unwavering love".
OL,11,FEthan Adams died following the
OL,12,Fcollision on the A34 between Abingdon
OL,13,Fand the Marcham Interchange on the
OL,14,Fmorning of 30 October.
OL,16,FThe road remained closed for a lengthy
OL,17,Fperiod of time following the crash,
OL,18,Fwhich National Highways said had
OL,19,Finvolved a motorcycle and a lorry at
OL,20,Fabout 07:40 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
