OL,3,GNEWSA'Unwavering love' of man killed in
OL,4,Acrash remembered
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute released by his family on
OL,7,FMonday, they said he would be "missed
OL,8,Fmore than words can say but never
OL,9,Fforgotten".
